  "id": "cultural-learning",
  "term": "cultural learning",
  "definition": "Cultural learning is the process of moving beyond surface recognition or factual knowledge about another culture to understand its symbols, meanings, assumptions, and perspectives in context. It also involves using that understanding to make broader intercultural judgments.",
